	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_002_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>よっしゃ　いっくぜー！　
ぼくの　パワー　みせてやる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>よっしゃ　いっくぜー！　
僕の　パワー　みせてやる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>たんパンこぞう２

ロンドン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_002_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ドッキリしたか！　ビックリしたか！
ぼくの　ポケモンの　パワーにっ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ドッキリしたか！　ビックリしたか！
僕の　ポケモンの　パワーにっ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ロンドン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_002_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すごいな　キミの　パワーは！
ビックリで　ドッキリだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すごいな　キミの　パワーは！
ビックリで　ドッキリだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
