		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せかいの　ポケモンを　みてまわるのが
オレの　たびの　もくてき　なんだべ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>世界の　ポケモンを　見て回るのが
オレの　旅の　目的　なんだべ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>シャムス</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_127_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼうけんが　オレを　よんでるぜ
では　さらばだ！　またあおうっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>冒険が　オレを　呼んでるぜ
では　さらばだ！　また会おうっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>シャムス</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_128_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まあ　きらくに　やろうじゃないの
じんせいも　ポケモンもさー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>まあ　気楽に　やろうじゃないの
人生も　ポケモンもさー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>バックパッカー♂２

クンヤ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_128_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>がむしゃらに　がんばるのも
いいけれど　よゆうが　ないとね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>がむしゃらに　頑張るのも
悪くないけれど　余裕ないとね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>クンヤ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_128_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まあ　だいじょぶ　だいじょぶ
きっと　つぎが　あるさー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>まあ　大丈夫　大丈夫
きっと　次が　あるさー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>クンヤ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_129_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ダーリン　さがして　さんぜんり！
あては　なくとも　たびは　つづくわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ダーリン　探して　三千里！
当ては　なくとも　旅は　続くわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>バックパッカー♀１

ズラータ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_129_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>リッチか　おかねもちか　ゆうふくな
とのがたが　いたら　おしえてよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>リッチか　お金持ちか　裕福な
殿方が　いたら　教えてよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ズラータ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_129_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゴールは　ウエディングロード……
でも　それってホントに　ユートピア？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ゴールは　ウエディングロード……
でも　それってホントに　ユートピア？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ズラータ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_130_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゲームは　じんせい　だけど
じんせいは　ゲームじゃないから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ゲームは　人生　だけど
人生は　ゲームじゃないから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>バックパッカー♀２

ゾーエ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_130_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしは　いつでも　しんけんだから
ゲームきぶんじゃ　かてないわよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>私は　いつでも　真剣だから
ゲーム気分じゃ　勝てないわよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ゾーエ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_130_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゲームを　すてて　たびに　でよ！
なーんつって　な！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ゲームを　捨てて　旅に　出よ！
なーんつって　な！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ゾーエ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_131_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すきなことして　いきていたいのだ
だからぼく　ずっとバイトで　いいのだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>好きなことして　生きていたいのだ
だから僕　ずっとバイトで　いいのだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ウエーター１

レオナルト</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_131_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じんせいは　いちどきり　なのだ
きみは　すきなこと　してるか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人生は　一度きり　なのだ
君は　好きなこと　してるか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>レオナルト</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_131_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>めんどうな　ことに　しばられず
ずっと　ここで　あそんでたいのだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>面倒な　ことに　縛られず
ずっと　ここで　遊んでたいのだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>レオナルト</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_132_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ボク　だれかの　えがおが　みたくて
いまの　しごとを　はじめたんだぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ボク　だれかの　笑顔が　みたくて
今の　仕事を　はじめたんだぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ウエーター２

ローレンツ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_132_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そんな　めで　みないでくれよ
さあ　スマイル！　スマイル！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そんな　目で　みないでくれよ
さあ　スマイル！　スマイル！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ローレンツ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_132_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>くやしいけれど　キミの　えがおが
みられたから　よかったかもな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>悔しいけれど　キミの　笑顔が
みられたから　良かったかもな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ローレンツ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_133_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いいから　さっさと　はじめよ！
ほら　じかん　もったいないよー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いいから　さっさと　始めよ！
ほら　時間　もったいないよー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ウエートレス１

エンガワ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_133_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>エー？　もう　おわちゃったの？
まだじかん　いっぱい　のこってるよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>エー？　もう　終わっちゃったの？
まだ時間　いっぱい　残ってるよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>エンガワ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_133_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちょっと　もー　じかんですー
えんちょうは　できませーん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ちょっと　もー　時間ですー
延長は　できませーん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>エンガワ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_134_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はたらいてる　おみせの　えいぎょうで
ここで　しょうぶ　してまーす</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>働いてる　お店の　営業で
ここで　勝負　してまーす</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ウエートレス２

コハダ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_134_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなた　あんまり　つよくないから
わたしの　みせには　むいてないね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなた　あんまり　強くないから
わたしの　店には　向いてないね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>かち</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_134_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きゃーん！　つよい　トレーナーさん！
こんどは　おみせで　あいましょ　ネ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きゃーん！　強い　トレーナーさん！
今度は　お店で　会いましょ　ネ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>コハダ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_135_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だいすきクラブに　にゅうかいしなさい
きみのじんせい　ハッピーになるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>だいすきクラブに　入会しなさい
きみの人生　ハッピーになるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>だいすきクラブ男１

セルジオ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_135_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だいすきクラブに　にゅうかいすれば
ワシのように　つよくなれるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>だいすきクラブに　入会すれば
ワシのように　強くなれるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>セルジオ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_135_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だいすきクラブに　はいれば
じんせい　すくわれるのだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>だいすきクラブに　入れば
人生　救われるのだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>セルジオ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_136_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もはや　だいすきクラブではないんだよ
だい　だいすきクラブ　なんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もはや　だいすきクラブではないんだよ
大　だいすきクラブ　なんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>だいすきクラブ男２

フェリペ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_136_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくは　ポケモンが　だいすきなんだよ
だい　だいすき　なんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくは　ポケモンが　大好きなんだよ
大　大好き　なんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>フェリペ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_136_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おぼえて　おきたまえ！　ぼくは
だい　だいすきクラブなんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>覚えて　おきたまえ！　僕は
大　だいすきクラブなんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>フェリペ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_137_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だいすき　ゆえ　われは　あり
すなわち　われ　だいすきなり</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大好き　ゆえ　我は　あり
即ち　我　大好きなり</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>だいすきクラブ女１

ビージャル</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_137_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だいすきは　ちからなり</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大好きは　力なり</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ビージャル</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_137_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おぼえておくが　いい
われは　だいすきなり</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>覚えておくが　いい
我は　大好きなり</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ビージャル</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_138_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わかく　うつくしい　ひとも　いるけど
わかさは　うつくしさじゃ　ないのよねえ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>若く　美しい　人も　いるけど
若さは　美しさじゃ　ないのよねえ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>だいすきクラブ女２

メリル</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_138_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わかいころに　きが　ついてりゃ
いまの　くろうは　なかったのにねえ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>若いころに　気が　ついてりゃ
今の　苦労は　なかったのにねえ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>メリル</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_138_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わかさは　わかさで　しかなかったのよ
それに　あのころ　きが　ついてりゃね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>若さは　若さでしか　なかったのよ
それに　あのころ　気が　ついてりゃね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>メリル</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_139_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ホウ　おまえが　オレさまの　まえに
たちはだかる　マウンテンかい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ホウ　お前が　オレ様の　前に
立ちはだかる　マウンテンかい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>やまおとこ１

タピオカ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_139_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤッホーーー！！　ヤッホーーー！！
オレの　おたけびが　こだまするぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤッホーーー！！　ヤッホーーー！！
オレの　雄たけびが　木霊するぜ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>タピオカ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_139_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>くうう……　オレさまの　しょうりは
クレバスへと　きえたか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>くうう……　オレさまの　勝利は
クレバスへと　消えたか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>タピオカ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_140_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハァーイ！　お　ま　た　せッ！
いちぶのアイドル　やまおとこよッ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハァーイ！　お　ま　た　せッ！
一部のアイドル　山男よッ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>やまおとこ２

ゲンゴロウ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_140_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アラー？　もう　おしまいなのー？
やまおとこ　ツマンナーイ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アラー？　もう　オシマイなのー？
山男　ツマンナーイ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ゲンゴロウ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_140_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たいせつなことよ！　おぼえといて！
ひとは　みためじゃ　ないのよん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大切なことよ！　覚えといて！
人は　見た目じゃ　ないのよん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ゲンゴロウ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_141_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こうみえて　わし　そしきの　ボスなの
みんなには　ないしょに　してよな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こうみえて　わし　組織の　ボスなの
みんなには　内緒に　してよな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>つりびと１

ダンカン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_141_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わしが　ここで　あそんどることは
だれにも　しゃべっちゃ　いかんぞい</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わしが　ここで　遊んどることは
だれにも　しゃべっちゃ　いかんぞい</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ダンカン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_141_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ボスには　じゆうが　ないんじゃ
つられた　ポケモンと　おなじじゃ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ボスには　自由が　ないんじゃ
釣られた　ポケモンと　同じじゃ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ダンカン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_142_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほんとうは　いっしょう　つりして
おだやかに　くらしたいんだがな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>本当は　一生　釣りして
穏やかに　暮らしたいんだがな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>つりびと２

モルガン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_142_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ああ　つりばかりして　くらしたい
かったり　まけたりには　あきたわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ああ　釣りばかりして　暮らしたい
勝ったり　負けたりには　飽きたわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>モルガン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_142_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>このくらいの　としに　なるとなあ
かとうが　まけようが　かわらんのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>このくらいの　歳に　なるとなあ
勝とうが　負けようが　変わらんのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>モルガン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_143_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もしもしー？　あたしー　え　いま？
いまから　しょうぶ　なんだー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もしもしー？　あたしー　え　今？
今から　勝負　なんだー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>パラソルおねえさん１

ココメーロ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_143_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ね　もしもし？　きこえるー？
いま　しょうぶ　かったからさー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ね　もしもし？　聞こえるー？
今　勝負　終わったからさー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ココメーロ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_143_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ああ　もしもしー？　きこえてるー？
もー　きいてー　まけちゃったのよー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ああ　もしもしー？　聞こえてるー？
もー聞いてー　負けちゃったのよー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ココメーロ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_144_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かれに　キミ　スコールみたいだ　って
いわれたんだけど　スコールってなに？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>彼に　キミ　スコールみたいだ　って
いわれたんだけど　スコールって何？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>パラソルおねえさん２

ヌゥン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_144_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ウ　ウ　ウワーン！　ウワーンッ！！
うれしくって　なみだが　でちゃうのー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ウ　ウ　ウワーン！　ウワーンッ！！
うれしくって　涙が　でちゃうのー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ヌゥン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_144_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ウ　ウ　ウワーン！　ウワーンッ！！
ウワーンッ！！　ウワーンッ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ウ　ウ　ウワーン！　ウワーンッ！！
ウワーンッ！！　ウワーンッ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ヌゥン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_145_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これから　たたかう　あいてにさ
おしゃべりなんて　いらないでしょ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これから　戦う　相手にさ
おしゃべりなんて　いらないでしょ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>パラソルおねえさん３

ポモドーロ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_145_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じんせい　まけたら　オシマイよ
だから　あたしは　ふんばるの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人生　負けたら　オシマイよ
だから　あたしは　踏んばるの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポモドーロ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_145_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みじめな　あたしを　みないで！
ほら　さっさと　いきなさいっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>惨めな　あたしを　みないで！
ほら　さっさと　いきなさいっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポモドーロ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_146_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アンタにゃ　アンタのみちが　ある
オイラにゃ　オイラのみちが　ある</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アンタにゃ　アンタの道が　ある
オイラにゃ　オイラの道が　ある</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>スキンヘッズ１

オリオン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_146_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オイラは　オイラのみちを　いくぜ
それしか　みちは　ねーもんな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オイラは　オイラの道を　いくぜ
それしか　道は　ねーもんな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>オリオン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_146_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アンタのみちも　けわしいだろうな
がんばんな　おうえん　してっから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アンタの道は　険しいだろうな
がんばんな　応援　してっから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>オリオン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_147_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おんどりゃー！　ワル　なめっとったら
ポケモン　わやくそに　しちゃるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おんどりゃー！　ワル　なめっとったら
ポケモン　わやくそに　しちゃるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>スキンヘッズ２

オベロン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_147_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もっと　たいぎいかと　おもったが
まー　さえん　こうげきじゃのぉ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もっと　たいぎいかと　思ったが
まー　さえん　攻撃じゃのぉ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>オベロン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_147_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あがーな　わざに　やられるんか！
あー　ぶち　はがえぇのうーー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あがーな　技に　やられるんか！
あー　ぶち　はがえぇのうーー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>オベロン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_148_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>パパも　ママも　ベテラントレーナー
なのに　ぼくは　おちこぼれさ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>パパも　ママも　ベテラントレーナー
なのに　ぼくは　落ちこぼれさ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
