		Label="mes_tower_tr_206_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まあ　とうぜんの　けっかだわね
かがくの　ちからって　スゲーのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>まあ　当然の　結果だわね
科学の　力って　スゲーのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ロッテ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_206_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かがくの　ちからより　スゲーちからを
もってんのね　あんたの　ポケモン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>科学の　力より　スゲー力を
持ってんのね　あんたの　ポケモン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ロッテ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_207_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけたら　あたらしく　かいはつした
くすりの　じっけん　てつだってネ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けたら　新しく　開発した
薬の　実験　手伝ってネ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>けんきゅういん♀２

テレーゼ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_207_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フヒヒヒ　きみ　まけちゃったネ
さあ　このくすり　のんでネ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フヒヒヒ　君　負けちゃったネ
さあ　この薬　飲んでネ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>テレーゼ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_207_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チッ　もうすこしで　じっけんだいが
てに　はいるとこ　だったのによ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チッ　もう少しで　実験台が
手に　入るとこ　だったのによ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>テレーゼ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_208_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひとは　なぜ　きそい　あらそうのか？
それが　けんきゅうの　テーマなんです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人は　なぜ　競い　争うのか？
それが　研究の　テーマなんです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>けんきゅういん♀３

ツヤコ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_208_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かったところで　あいての　きもちを
きずつけることが　あるというのに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>勝ったところで　相手の　気持ちを
傷つけることが　あるというのに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ツヤコ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_208_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけて　しまえば　あいてへの
うらみが　わくことも　あるのに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けて　しまえば　相手への
恨みが　わくことも　あるのに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ツヤコ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_tower_tr_209_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハイッ！！　しゅうちゅうッ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハイッ！！　集中ッ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
